Package: tos-perfmon
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: QA Team <qa@example.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), systemd
Description: TOS Performance Monitor
 A performance monitoring application for TOS 7 that collects
 system and per-process metrics directly from /proc, detects
 memory leaks using slope analysis and monotonicity testing,
 and presents results in an interactive dashboard.
 .
 Features:
  - Per-process RSS, anonymous memory, file descriptors, threads
  - System-wide memory, slab, load, CPU, temperature
  - Automatic leak detection with configurable thresholds
  - Time-series trend visualization
